  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** The company is pivoting decisively from low-margin battery hardware to high-margin recurring software, led by the PowerTrack™ platform. This deliberate shift is improving revenue quality and driving record gross margins, even as total reported sales are temporarily depressed by planned hardware declines. The energy transition backdrop provides a supportive demand tailwind, and there is no mention of near‑term competitive or regulatory disruption, suggesting the software niche is gaining traction.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is executing the software‑centric strategy with clear operational discipline, having now delivered four consecutive quarters of positive adjusted EBITDA. The team reaffirmed full‑year guidance, signalling confidence in the trajectory and building market credibility around the turnaround. The emphasis on cost controls and high‑margin growth has produced record profitability, indicating that the pivot is being managed effectively and the higher‑quality earnings profile is becoming entrenched.",
